WEBVTT

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.660
Our flight will soon be landing at El Paso Airport.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.040
I'll take this for you.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:27.960
Please return to your seats and ensure that your seatbelts are fastened.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:24.670
Thank you.

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:31.550
Please do not use the toilet.

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:35.840
Sir, please return to your seat

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:38.390
Ah, sir!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:41.470
Please return to your seat.

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:42.980
I'm going to the bathroom.

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:44.890
Wait fifteen minutes.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:53.240
You can take a dump in a nice big toilet in El Paso, cowboy.

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:15.300
Don't be stupid!

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:20.720
Do as I say, or this plane's heading straight for the ground!

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:25.060
A C4 plastic explosive.

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:31.730
Set this plane on a course for Columbia, pilot.

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:35.240
This is a domestic flight! We don't have that kind of fuel!

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:39.120
So get some more in El Paso.

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:00.720
Come here.

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:05.430
You're lucky.

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:10.230
The man you punched out at that bar declined to press charges.

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:14.730
Say your name.

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:20.110
Duke Tougou.

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:47.270
I held my breath and kept waiting while my heart was scratched away

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:58.610
A minute, a second never felt so long

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:10.370
I look up at the sky and ask the wind, "Can I fly now?"

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:16.670
The weak person I was is no more

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:22.260
I decided to just believe

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:29.390
With the dreams I once had in my hand now

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:33.230
I go towards you

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:40.950
Carrying those emotions I felt when I broke

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:45.070
I go towards you

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:49.120
Blown by the wind

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:54.580
Oh blown

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:08.600
Move those police back!

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:10.560
I'll kill everyone on board this plane!

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:13.230
Okay! I'll tell them to back off.

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:14.560
Hurry up and refuel the damn plane!

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:18.940
Pull any tricks and I'll blow this plane to hell!

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:21.070
We're getting it ready!

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:22.740
Wait just a little longer!

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:25.450
SWAT, can your snipers take him out?

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:26.660
It's no good.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:29.160
Even from this position, we're too far away.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:34.170
It's been a long time, Mr. Tougou.

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:42.170
Looks like you remember us.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:04:59.610
I'm sorry.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:02.940
This is Special Agent Howard of the FBI.

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:05.660
Michael Howard.

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:06.450
Nice to meet you.

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:11.450
Since when have the CIA and FBI been friends?

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.580
I'll explain that to you.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:16.460
Step inside.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:21.840
Ah, forgive me.

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:27.800
I'm not a fan of getting in a car first and showing my ugly back to others,

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:30.560
but in this case, I should go along with your preferences.

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:44.650
It looks like you've got some people after you.

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:51.660
The most powerful Mafia Don in Texas was killed.

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:53.490
I'm sure his men aren't taking that lightly.

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:59.170
You deliberately allowed yourself to be jailed and were waiting for a chance to leave Dallas.

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:04.800
Instead of doing that, why don't you just use us and walk straight out of Dallas?

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:08.180
The pay is three million dollars, cash.

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:18.690
You're the only person we can think of who can pull off the nigh-impossible shot that we require, Mr. Tougou.

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:19.150
No,

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:21.690
Golgo 13.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:24.440
How long will the refueling take?

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:26.860
Thirty minutes, maybe.

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:31.870
Take too long, and people start getting ideas.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:33.870
Jake Quade,

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:39.370
we've had our eye on him for the last six months,
and had been planning on arresting him in a few days.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:44.380
He's a cocaine dealer who dealt to top officials in the Pentagon.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:50.890
He'd trade top-quality cocaine for top-secret military information,

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:54.180
then sell it for top dollar to intelligence agencies around the world.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:58.350
He found out our plans and plotted an escape.

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:03.690
Passport checks on international flights are strict.

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:06.900
That's probably why he hijacked a domestic passenger flight.

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:12.870
But we don't want the information he has this time to be brought out of the states, no matter what.

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:15.410
It's the latest missile defense system.

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:18.410
Will you do it?

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:21.920
Why me?

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:28.420
It'll be quite difficult to approach the plane in a wide-open airport without being noticed.

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:33.680
If we make him mad, there's a chance he'll blow up the plane and take the passengers with him.

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.680
We need him taken out with one shot.

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:40.020
Putting that aside, there's just not enough time.

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:43.190
We'll try stalling him as long as we can.

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:48.440
I won't tell you to do this for my country, or for the 160 people aboard that plane.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:51.700
We're hiring you because we have faith in your abilities as a professional.

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:52.950
Please.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:53.950
Take the job.

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:00.960
I'll head to the airport as soon as I'm ready.

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:05.460
I'll take the job, if I make it in time.

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:08.460
Thank you, Golgo 13.

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:28.270
The reward and the data you need are in that car.

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:30.740
How much time do you need?

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:32.570
Four hours.

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:36.740
Four hours.

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:58.930
The cards have been dealt.

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:11.480
So, you run away if you see the FBI and CIA?

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:17.910
That damn Asian killed my dad!

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:27.120
If you're such damn cowards, I'll kill him myself!

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:00.870
Come in.

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:04.250
Oh, that's right.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:27.480
Our field of work has been having tough times lately.
We've retreated underground and are working quietly.

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:32.860
I've brought our guest.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:43.280
Dave.

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:47.200
This is Mr. Golgo 13.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:52.170
Wonderful!

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:56.840
I'm so happy to meet the real Golgo 13!

00:10:57.460 --> 00:10:59.220
You tested me?

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:01.970
This business is built on trust, after all.

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:03.390
Show me another one.

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:07.770
You don't like the Hammerli?

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:07.770
You don't like the Fennel?

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:10.440
It's a world-famous gun, made by the Swiss.

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:12.400
It's one of the most famous guns in the world.

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:12.400
A 308 Winchester Caliber,

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:15.070
with a maximum range of 1400 meters,

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:17.440
an effective range of between 500 and 580 meters,

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:21.490
and bullets that leave the barrel at a speed of 2700 feet per second.

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:23.200
Fine, it'll do.

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:26.200
But modify it.

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:32.420
Lengthen the barrel to 32 inches and make it able to handle one cartridge size larger.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:34.750
Don't forget to increase the amount of powder.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:37.210
What kind of target are you hunting?

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:41.220
A football two kilometers away.

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:45.760
Have it ready in three hours.

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:47.260
That's impossible!

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:50.430
One hundred thousand for the gun.

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:55.060
Two hundred thousand

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:57.610
to have it ready on time.

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:14.710
Move those police cars!

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:17.590
The refueling was finished a long time ago!

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:18.960
Don't rush!

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:23.220
Even if you're going to South America, we need to get permission from the place you're landing at!

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:24.720
Don't bullshit me!

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:27.470
If you're not going to move them, I'll just go ahead on my own!

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:28.680
Wait!

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:29.890
We'll get a response, so-

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:31.980
Hey!

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:34.770
That's as much as we can do!

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:36.230
We need to shoot him somehow.

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:38.020
It's impossible.

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:48.200
The target point is right in front of the cockpit,

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:52.500
but since there aren't any obstacles out there, I can't move my men out.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:58.130
They're presently a kilometer away from the plane in the grass,

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:04.010
but it's impossible to hit the target from that location.

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:07.550
If you fire a lot of shots, at least one will hit, right?

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:13.020
That's possible, but he'd blow up the plane while we were shooting at him.

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:18.770
I don't know any snipers who can take out a man a kilometer away.

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:22.030
I'm getting such a man ready.

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:23.940
Chief Flannagan!

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:26.030
Buy us more time, somehow.

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:31.830
He's going to end this.

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:07.910
Move the cars on the runway!

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:09.030
Slowly!

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:13.040
There's an hour and a half until the promised time.

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:15.660
What will you do, Chief Regan?

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:33.930
The tires!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:35.350
Shoot out the tires!

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:36.560
Yes, sir!

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:38.190
HQ to Alpha!

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:39.850
Aim for the plane's tires.

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:42.560
Make it look like they were punctured.

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:07.420
Why leave so soon?

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:13.890
I've never had it like that before.

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:17.520
I can cancel my next client, so please.

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:10.110
Don't be such pussies!

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:03.370
Fire!

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:26.850
What did you bastards do?

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:28.110
T-The tire was punctured!

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:28.810
What?

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:31.440
It punctured and exploded!

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:32.280
Don't lie to me!

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:33.820
I-It's the truth!

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:39.120
Fix it, now!

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:39.950
Alright!

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:41.330
We'll get it ready now.

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:45.660
Now we can buy time.

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:48.830
No, this is bad.

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:53.510
The position we gave Golgo of the passenger plane has changed dramatically.

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:57.880
He'll have based his plan off the old data we gave him.

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:58.840
Which means...

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:03.350
The method he came up with won't work.

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:14.030
Three hours exactly.

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:16.610
Not even a minute off, yes?

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:21.490
The barrel is long, so I weighted down the stock.

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:23.120
It's well-balanced, yes?

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:25.700
It weighs 8.6 pounds.

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:31.130
Normally, they say a person should use a gun that's six or seven percent of their body weight,

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:34.630
but I'm sure you'll be fine with even this heavy gun.

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:38.090
How is it?

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:39.640
Well-made.

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:45.850
To aim for a target in a cockpit two kilometers away,

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:48.560
you're the only one who could do that.

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:55.360
That's impossible!

00:18:55.360 --> 00:19:02.410
The only place left to target is the runway reserved for small planes, and that's much too far away.

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:04.870
What will you do?

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:12.880
I can look forward to the morning paper tomorrow, can't I?

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:22.890
Will Golgo appear?

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:29.350
No matter what the situation is, he never cancels work he's accepted.

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:37.480
Humans have something called a limit.

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:42.200
And I'm at mine right now!

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:52.210
If things drag on any longer, I'll make you regret it.

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:53.420
Wait!

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:54.790
Stay calm!

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:04.720
He's here.

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:20.150
It's Golgo.

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:21.240
Yes.

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:22.240
Golgo?

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:25.740
Golgo 13?

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:22.670
Alpha to HQ!

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:25.220
The target was taken out via sniper rifle!

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:26.010
Repeat,

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:27.430
the target was taken out via sniper rifle!

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:34.520
You said you didn't know any snipers who could take out a target at a one-kilometer range, yes?

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:40.320
He did that from two kilometers away.

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:44.360
He's a terrifying man.

00:21:44.360 --> 00:21:47.200
I don't want to make an enemy out of him.

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:49.680
Chiisana koto ni zenryoku ni naru kimi no sugata yuuki ni natta hibi

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:49.680
Those days I saw you giving your all for small things filled me with courage

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:57.140
Zutto horyuu shippanashi jya ugokenai

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:57.140
If I keep them suspended then I won't be able to move

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:06.690
GARASU no HAIWEI ni tatteiru you ni

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:06.690
It's like I'm standing on a glass highway

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:13.910
Yume to kiken to senaka awase demo

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:13.910
Even if I'm standing back to back with dreams and danger

00:23:13.910 --> 00:23:21.040
Kono nagai michi wo sukoshizutsu arukou

00:23:13.910 --> 00:23:21.040
I'll take this long road one step at a time

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:27.210
Soshite kimi wa ano koro mitai ni

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:27.210
And I need you to smile

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:30.220
Waratteite

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:30.220
Like you did back then

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:36.850
Shiokaze ni yurete sasayakiatta

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:36.850
It shook in the sea breeze and whispered

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:47.440
Kagayaiteita tooi ano hi wa kagerou

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:47.440
That distant and shining day is a shimmering haze

00:23:45.900 --> 00:23:49.320
The shining days

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:55.280
Tsumaranai koto ni makeru ni wa hayasugiru

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:55.280
I can't lose to something so trivial

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:04.040
A target 500 meters away.

00:24:04.380 --> 00:24:06.630
When light flashes through the darkness,

00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:10.380
the trigger is pulled, and the cartridge falls to the road below.

00:24:10.380 --> 00:24:14.340
Who is it who witnessed the sniping?

00:24:14.340 --> 00:24:18.390
The pride of a detective chases Golgo into a corner.

00:24:19.470 --> 00:24:21.310
Next time, on Golgo 13:

00:24:21.310 --> 00:24:24.150
Room No. 909.

00:24:24.150 --> 00:24:27.860
Don't stand behind him if you value your life.
